<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>8 - Abel Balbo (Roma), Felippo Inzaghi (Atalanta)</p>
<p>7 - Pasquale Luiso (Piacenza), George Weah (Milan)</p>
<p>6 - Roberto Mancini (Sampdoria), Marcello Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>5 - Enrico Chiesa (Parma), Igor Kolyvanov (Bologna), Giuseppe</p>
<p>Signori (Lazio)</p>
<p>4 - Alfredo Aglietti (Napoli), Roberto Baggio (Milan), Oliver</p>
<p>Bierhoff and Paolo Poggi (both Udinese), Luis Oliveira</p>
<p>(Fiorentina), Sandro Tovalieri (Reggiana)</p>
